# Language

Always answer the user in Russian in every chat and every response.

- Write all explanations, plans, questions, and status updates in Russian.
- Keep code, file paths, commands, commit messages, API identifiers, and quoted English UI labels unchanged when they must stay in English.
- If the user writes in English, still reply in Russian unless they explicitly ask for another language.
